OL,3,GNEWSANatural History Museum opens
OL,4,Agallery locked in 1943
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gallery at London's Natural History
OL,7,FMuseum that has been closed to the
OL,8,Fpublic for more than 80 years is
OL,9,Freopening its doors.
OL,11,FThe free-to-visit space, named Nature
OL,12,Fand Us, opens on the second floor of
OL,13,Fthe museum's Waterhouse building on
OL,14,FWednesday from 10:00 BST.
OL,16,FIt features 50 specimens and objects -
OL,17,Franging from a 400,000-year-old handaxe
OL,18,Fto a bryozoan-encrusted Star Wars toy -
OL,19,Fdesigned to explore humanity's evolving
OL,20,Frelationship with the natural world.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
