OL,3,GNEWSANatural History Museum opens
OL,4,Agallery locked in 1943
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Doug Gurr, director of the museum,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's a wonderful space with a
OL,8,Ffascinating history, and we're excited
OL,9,Ffor visitors to discover it for
OL,10,Fthemselves."
